@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Hello with the default name
GET {{host}}/api/hello

### Hello with a name
GET {{host}}/api/hello?name=Go

### Echo
POST {{host}}/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "ping"}

### Error shape: missing message
POST {{host}}/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Error shape: unknown route
GET {{host}}/missing

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/api/openapi.yaml

### Swagger UI (open in a browser)
GET {{host}}/api/docs
